---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Refund Policy — Shri Kundali">
  <div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 0">
    <h1 style="color:#8b4513;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Refund Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      We want you to be completely satisfied with your Kundali report. If you're not happy with your purchase, we offer a straightforward refund process.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:#8b4513;font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">24-Hour No-Questions Refund</h2>
    <p style="color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      If you request a refund within <strong>24 hours</strong> of your purchase, we will issue a full refund with no questions asked. Simply contact us with your payment details.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:#8b4513;font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">How to Request a Refund</h2>
    <p style="color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Email us at <a href="mailto:support@shrikundali.com" style="color:#8b4513">support@shrikundali.com</a> with:
    </p>
    <ul style="color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-left:1.5rem">
      <li>Your name and email used for the purchase</li>
      <li>Payment ID or order ID</li>
      <li>Reason for refund (optional)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="color:#8b4513;font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Refund Processing</h2>
    <p style="color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Refunds are processed within 5-7 business days and credited to the original payment method. You will receive a confirmation email once the refund is initiated.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:#8b4513;font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Exceptions</h2>
    <p style="color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Refund requests made after 24 hours of purchase may be considered on a case-by-case basis. We reserve the right to deny refund requests that appear to be abusive or fraudulent.
    </p>

    <p style="color:#888;font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid #f0e6d6;padding-top:1rem">
      Last updated: September 2026
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
